## Development

```bash
make fmt               # terraform fmt -recursive
make validate          # terraform validate
make lint              # tflint
make test              # terraform test — tests/, mocked providers, no credentials
make integration-test  # Terratest under test/ — provisions real infrastructure
```

`make test` runs the native suite in [`tests/`](tests/). It mocks the
`{{ .Provider }}` provider, so it needs no credentials and is safe in CI —
`.github/workflows/ci.yml` runs it on every pull request. It needs Terraform
>= 1.7 for `mock_provider`; the module itself only requires
`{{ .TerraformVersion }}`.

